option "title" "v3 differential fixture ledger"
option "operating_currency" "EUR"

; Accounts carry a bucket: open-meta so open_meta(account) / getitem(...) can be
; exercised. Multiple currencies (EUR/USD/ACME) with a price chain exercise
; CONVERT; #exclude tags exercise `NOT "exclude" IN tags`; cost lots exercise
; units()/number()/cost(); RealEstate exercises the `NOT account ~ RealEstate`
; filter cortex uses for net worth.

2022-12-31 open Assets:Bank:EUR EUR
  bucket: "Cash"
2022-12-31 open Assets:Bank:USD USD
  bucket: "Cash"
2022-12-31 open Assets:Invest:Stocks:ACME ACME
  bucket: "Investments"
2022-12-31 open Assets:RealEstate:Flat EUR
  bucket: "RealEstate"
2022-12-31 open Income:Salary EUR
2022-12-31 open Income:Gains USD
2022-12-31 open Expenses:Food:Groceries EUR
2022-12-31 open Expenses:Food:Restaurant EUR
2022-12-31 open Expenses:Travel EUR
2022-12-31 open Equity:Opening

2023-01-01 price USD 0.90 EUR
2023-01-01 price ACME 100.00 USD

; Explicit per-currency Equity legs: the Go engine does not yet elaborate a
; single blank posting across multiple currencies the way beancount v3 does
; (an edge case our real ledger never hits, since every txn balances in one
; currency). Kept explicit so the fixture loads identically in both engines.
2023-01-02 * "Opening balances"
  Assets:Bank:EUR         5000.00 EUR
  Assets:RealEstate:Flat 250000.00 EUR
  Equity:Opening        -255000.00 EUR
  Assets:Bank:USD         2000.00 USD
  Equity:Opening          -2000.00 USD

2023-01-15 * "Acme" "January salary" #salary
  Assets:Bank:EUR   2500.00 EUR
  Income:Salary

2023-02-10 * "Carrefour" "Groceries" #food
  Expenses:Food:Groceries   80.00 EUR
  Assets:Bank:EUR

2023-02-20 * "Bistro" "Dinner out" #food #exclude
  Expenses:Food:Restaurant   60.00 EUR
  Assets:Bank:EUR

2023-03-01 * "Broker" "Buy ACME"
  Assets:Invest:Stocks:ACME   10 ACME {100.00 USD}
  Assets:Bank:USD   -1000.00 USD

2023-04-12 * "Airline" "Flight" #trip
  Expenses:Travel   450.00 EUR
  Assets:Bank:EUR

2023-11-05 * "Carrefour" "Groceries" #food
  Expenses:Food:Groceries   95.00 EUR
  Assets:Bank:EUR

2024-01-15 * "Acme" "January salary" #salary
  Assets:Bank:EUR   2600.00 EUR
  Income:Salary

2024-03-20 * "Broker" "Sell some ACME"
  Assets:Invest:Stocks:ACME   -3 ACME {100.00 USD} @ 130.00 USD
  Assets:Bank:USD   390.00 USD
  Income:Gains

2024-05-02 * "Bistro" "Dinner" #food
  Expenses:Food:Restaurant   72.00 EUR
  Assets:Bank:EUR

2024-06-30 price USD 0.92 EUR
2024-06-30 price ACME 130.00 USD
